    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>line-chunk-prefix · 4×1×1 workgroups × 64×1×1 lanes = 256 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-line-chunk-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect><rect x=\"21\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"41\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"61\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"3\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 64\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-line-chunk-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"64\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"2\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAACAAAAACCAMAAAAOwC77AAAAA1BMVEVfZnJNNohmAAAATUlEQVR4AQFCAL3/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEIAAb1u9mUAAAAASUVORK5CYII=\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>64 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const positionsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; positions: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const lineOffsetsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; lineOffsets: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const rowMeasuresOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; rowMeasures: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const LINE_COUNT: u32 = 223u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"12\">const ROW_COUNT: u32 = 513u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">const PREFIX_LANES: u32 = 64u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"14\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; largeBits: array&lt;atomic&lt;u32&gt;, 2&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; largeBitsCopy: array&lt;u32, 2&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; largeStart: array&lt;u32, 64&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; largeEnd: array&lt;u32, 64&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; prefixCarry: array&lt;f32, 3&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; tileLengths: array&lt;f32, 64&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; tileShifts: array&lt;f32, 64&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">fn getAdditionRoundingError(first: f32, second: f32, sum: f32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">  let firstBits = bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(first);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">  let secondBits = bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(second);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">  let sumBits = bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(sum);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">  let firstMagnitude = firstBits &amp; 0x7fffffffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">  let secondMagnitude = secondBits &amp; 0x7fffffffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">  let sumMagnitude = sumBits &amp; 0x7fffffffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">  // A zero operand makes the addition exact; an infinity or a NaN has no rounding error to report.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">  if (firstMagnitude == 0u || secondMagnitude == 0u ||\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">      max(max(firstMagnitude, secondMagnitude), sumMagnitude) &gt;= 0x7f800000u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">    return 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">  let firstIsLarger = firstMagnitude &gt;= secondMagnitude;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">  let largerBits = select(secondBits, firstBits, firstIsLarger);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">  let smallerBits = select(firstBits, secondBits, firstIsLarger);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">  let largerMagnitude = largerBits &amp; 0x7fffffffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">  let smallerMagnitude = smallerBits &amp; 0x7fffffffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">  // Biased exponents (1 for subnormals) and 24-bit significands: |value| = significand * 2^(exponent - 150).\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">  let largerExponent = max(largerMagnitude &gt;&gt; 23u, 1u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">  let smallerExponent = max(smallerMagnitude &gt;&gt; 23u, 1u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">  let sumExponent = max(sumMagnitude &gt;&gt; 23u, 1u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">  // Below 2^-103 the error would be subnormal, where ldexp is not dependable: report none.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">  if (smallerExponent &lt; 24u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">    return 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">  let gap = largerExponent - smallerExponent;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">  if (gap &gt; 25u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">    // The smaller operand is below a quarter of the larger one&#39;s last place: the sum is the larger\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">    // operand and the whole smaller operand is the error.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">    if (sumBits == largerBits) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">      return bitcast&lt;f32&gt;(smallerBits);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">    return 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">  // The sum&#39;s last place, as a left shift from the smaller operand&#39;s last place. A rounded sum has\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">  // the larger operand&#39;s exponent, the next one (a carry) or the one below (a borrow). Anything\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">  // lower is a cancellation, which is exact, and so is a sum whose last place is finer than the\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"60\">  // smaller operand&#39;s.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">  if (sumMagnitude == 0u || sumExponent + 1u &lt; largerExponent || sumExponent &gt; largerExponent + 1u ||\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"62\">      sumExponent &lt; smallerExponent) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"63\">    return 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"64\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"65\">  let sumShift = sumExponent - smallerExponent;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"66\">  let largerSignificand = (largerMagnitude &amp; 0x7fffffu) | select(0u, 0x800000u, largerMagnitude &gt;= 0x800000u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"67\">  let smallerSignificand = (smallerMagnitude &amp; 0x7fffffu) | select(0u, 0x800000u, smallerMagnitude &gt;= 0x800000u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"68\">  let sumSignificand = (sumMagnitude &amp; 0x7fffffu) | select(0u, 0x800000u, sumMagnitude &gt;= 0x800000u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"69\">  // Signed integers in units of the smaller operand&#39;s last place, modulo 2^32. Each term can pass\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"70\">  // 2^32, but their combination is at most 2^25 in magnitude, so the wrapped result is exact.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"71\">  let largerUnits = largerSignificand &lt;&lt; gap;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"72\">  let sumUnits = sumSignificand &lt;&lt; sumShift;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"73\">  let signedLarger = select(largerUnits, 0u - largerUnits, (largerBits &amp; 0x80000000u) != 0u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"74\">  let signedSmaller = select(smallerSignificand, 0u - smallerSignificand, (smallerBits &amp; 0x80000000u) != 0u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"75\">  let signedSum = select(sumUnits, 0u - sumUnits, (sumBits &amp; 0x80000000u) != 0u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"76\">  let errorUnits = bitcast&lt;i32&gt;(signedLarger + signedSmaller - signedSum);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"77\">  // The rounding error of an addition is an f32, so the conversion and the scaling are exact.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"78\">  return ldexp(f32(errorUnits), i32(smallerExponent) - 150);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"79\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"80\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"81\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"82\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"83\">const RADIUS: f32 = 1.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"84\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"85\">fn getPosition(row: u32) -&gt; vec2&lt;f32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"86\">  return vec2&lt;f32&gt;(positions[positionsOffset + 2u * row], positions[positionsOffset + 2u * row + 1u]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"87\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"88\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"89\">fn getSegmentLength(a: vec2&lt;f32&gt;, b: vec2&lt;f32&gt;) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"90\">  return length(b - a);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"91\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"92\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"93\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"94\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"95\">@compute @workgroup_size(64)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"96\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"97\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"98\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"99\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"100\">  _ = &amp;positions;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"101\">  _ = &amp;lineOffsets;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"102\">  _ = &amp;rowMeasures;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"103\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"104\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"105\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"106\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"107\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 67108864u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"108\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 64u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"109\">  \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"110\">  let lane = localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"111\">  let lineBase = workgroupIndex * PREFIX_LANES;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"112\">  let ownLine = lineBase + lane;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"113\">  // Phase 1: this lane&#39;s own line, serially when small; larger lines are queued for phase 2.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"114\">  if (ownLine &lt; LINE_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"115\">    let first = min(lineOffsets[lineOffsetsOffset + ownLine], ROW_COUNT);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"116\">    let last = min(max(lineOffsets[lineOffsetsOffset + ownLine + 1u], first), ROW_COUNT);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"117\">    if (last &gt; first) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"118\">      if (last - first &lt;= PREFIX_LANES) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"119\">        var sum = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"120\">        var compensation = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"121\">        var shift = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"122\">        var previous = getPosition(first);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"123\">        rowMeasures[rowMeasuresOffset + first] = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"124\">        \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"125\">        for (var row = first + 1u; row &lt; last; row++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"126\">          let current = getPosition(row);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"127\">          let segmentLength = getSegmentLength(previous, current);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"128\">          let nextSum = sum + segmentLength;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"129\">          compensation = compensation + getAdditionRoundingError(sum, segmentLength, nextSum);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"130\">          sum = nextSum;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"131\">          rowMeasures[rowMeasuresOffset + row] = sum + compensation;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"132\">          \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"133\">          previous = current;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"134\">        }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"135\">      } else {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"136\">        largeStart[lane] = first;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"137\">        largeEnd[lane] = last;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"138\">        atomicOr(&amp;largeBits[lane / 32u], 1u &lt;&lt; (lane % 32u));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"139\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"140\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"141\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"142\">  workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"143\">  if (lane == 0u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"144\">    largeBitsCopy[0] = atomicLoad(&amp;largeBits[0]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"145\">    largeBitsCopy[1] = atomicLoad(&amp;largeBits[1]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"146\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"147\">  // Phase 2: every barrier below is in workgroup-uniform control flow (the queue is read through\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"148\">  // workgroupUniformLoad), and the queued lines are visited in ascending order.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"149\">  for (var word = 0u; word &lt; 2u; word++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"150\">    var pending = workgroupUniformLoad(&amp;largeBitsCopy[word]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"151\">    while (pending != 0u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"152\">      let slot = word * 32u + firstTrailingBit(pending);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"153\">      pending = pending &amp; (pending - 1u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"154\">      let lineStart = workgroupUniformLoad(&amp;largeStart[slot]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"155\">      let lineEnd = workgroupUniformLoad(&amp;largeEnd[slot]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"156\">      if (lane == 0u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"157\">        rowMeasures[rowMeasuresOffset + lineStart] = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"158\">        \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"159\">        prefixCarry[0] = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"160\">        prefixCarry[1] = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"161\">        prefixCarry[2] = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"162\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"163\">      for (var tileStart = lineStart + 1u; tileStart &lt; lineEnd; tileStart += PREFIX_LANES) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"164\">        let row = tileStart + lane;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"165\">        var segmentLength = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"166\">        var segmentShift = 0.0;\n</span><sp